ody goes up that road at night. Not even lights, till tonight."],"doing":"stands with arms folded watching the moor road; points east, looks cross"},{"id":"chestnut-roaster","name":"The chestnut roaster","x":6.406,"z":-4.801,"says":["Here, a handful for the road. No, put your purse away.","Went straight over my head, the lot of them. Nearly had my hat.","My coals went grey as they passed. Then they came back. Like they'd been asked and said no."],"doing":"stands turning chestnuts over the brazier; beckons and laughs"},{"id":"captain","name":"The captain","x":1.007,"z":-9.606,"says":["Twelve lamps. They tore off their hooks and went east like geese.","I don't take her up dark. Bring my lamps home and I'll fly you wherever you point.","They all went one way. Toward the old beacon on the crag. That fire's been out longer than I've been flying."],"doing":"walks from post to post looking up at the empty brackets on the hull; turns to the party when spoken to"}],"spots":[],"lamps":[[-8.2,-2.9,2.15],[8.9,-4.6,2.15],[6.6,-6.4,0.6]],"happens":[{"code":"W3-a","title":"Twelve lamps go","kind":"scene"},{"code":"W3-b","title":"Wisps at the brazier","kind":"fight"},{"code":"W3-c","title":"Only tonight","kind":"talk"},{"code":"W3-d","title":"The lamps come home","kind":"scene"},{"code":"W3-e","title":"Twelve stitches","kind":"gate"}]},"W4":{"id":"W4","name":"The Last Lantern","zone":2,"light":"night","at":[31.75,101.9],"base":5.0,"camera":{"fov":12,"pitch":24,"target":[0,0,-2.5],"span":10.7},"skyBand":0.15,"moon":{"u":0.105,"v":0.072,"d":0.085},"camPos":[0,20.7036,44.0012],"figure":[-3,0.5],"foot":[[-8.66,8.14],[8.66,8.14],[12.77,-13.28],[-12.77,-13.28]],"solids":[{"kind":"cone","name":"heather knoll with bare rock","x":11,"z":-10.2,"r":3,"h":2.6},{"kind":"cone","name":"gorse bush","x":-2.6,"z":-9,"r":1.2,"h":1.1},{"kind":"cone","name":"wind-bent thorn tree","x":4.6,"z":-8.6,"r":1.5,"h":3.6},{"kind":"cone","name":"gorse bush","x":7.4,"z":-8.4,"r":1,"h":1.1},{"kind":"cone","name":"